<title>NIGERIA: Nigerian Guaranty Bank raises half-yr profit.</title>
<headline>Nigerian Guaranty Bank raises half-yr profit.</headline>
<dateline>LAGOS 1996-10-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Half year result for Guaranty Trust</p>
<p>Bank to end-August 1996. (In million naira)</p>
<p>				   1996	  1995</p>
<p>Turnover			1,600    vs   886</p>
<p>Profit before taxation	404    vs   430</p>
<p>Taxation			  128    vs   159</p>
<p>Profit after taxation	 275    vs   271</p>
<p>Interim Dividend		100    vs    50</p>
<p>Interim dividend per share   25 kobo vs nil</p>
<p>NOTE - Guaranty Trust Bank's 400 million ordinary shares were listed on the Nigerian Stock Exchange on September 9, 1996. ($1=80 naira)</p>
<p>-- Lagos newsroom +234 1 263 03 17</p>
</text>
